  "objectives": [
    "Represent two-dimensional vectors using either magnitude and direction or equivalent x- and y-components.",
    "Add vectors graphically with the tip-to-tail method and identify the resultant vector.",
    "Decompose a vector into horizontal and vertical components using right-triangle trigonometry and reconstruct the original vector.",
    "Explain the independence of horizontal and vertical motion in ideal projectile motion.",
    "Describe how a projectile\u2019s horizontal velocity, vertical velocity, and position change throughout flight, including the zero vertical velocity at maximum height.",
    "Predict how launch angle and launch speed affect trajectory, range, and maximum height, including the angle that maximizes range for a fixed launch speed."
